# ── Raw data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Download online_retail_II.xlsx from UCI — see GET_THE_DATA.md
data/raw/*

# ── Processed data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The three large intermediates are NOT committed. Regenerate them with
#   python src/build_dataset.py
#   python src/build_dashboard_tables.py
# transactions_clean.csv is 169 MB, well past GitHub's file-size limit.
data/processed/transactions_clean.csv
data/processed/baskets.csv
data/processed/dashboard/fact_weekly_demand.csv

# Everything else under data/processed/ IS committed on purpose: the
# deployed Streamlit app reads sku_profile.csv, sku_weekly.csv,
# inventory_policy.csv, association_rules.csv, forecast_accuracy.csv and
# pullthrough_test.csv at runtime, so the app breaks without them.

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Office / Power BI temp files ───────────────────────────────────────
*.pbix.tmp
~$*

# ── Word documents ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The department's repository template is explicit: documentation lives in
# Markdown (docs/documentation.md), not Word. The .docx is generated from the
# same source for formal submission and is kept locally only.
report/
*.docx

# ── Private working notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Writing scaffold and viva rehearsal list — prep material, not project
# documentation. Kept on disk, deliberately not published.
docs/WRITING_NOTES.md

# ── OS / IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
